{"about_the_game":"<strong><u>EASY DELIVERY</u></strong><br>Use the hand truck to unload large deliveries easily. You can also organize boxes or transport them to storage with the hand truck.<br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850080/extras/58555acdb4f568efd555893b0c8be69e.poster.avif?t=1751990646\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850080/extras/58555acdb4f568efd555893b0c8be69e.webm?t=1751990646\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850080/extras/58555acdb4f568efd555893b0c8be69e.mp4?t=1751990646\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><br><strong><u>RESTOCK SHELVES</u></strong><br>Restock the shelves and keep your supermarket fully stocked at all times. Keep your shelves organized<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850080/extras/b5018a979697ec2bc27deecdb764c13b.poster.avif?t=1751990646\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850080/extras/b5018a979697ec2bc27deecdb764c13b.webm?t=1751990646\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850080/extras/b5018a979697ec2bc27deecdb764c13b.mp4?t=1751990646\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><br><strong><u>HANDLE PAYMENTS</u></strong><br>Process cash or credit card payments quickly with easy-to-use UIs. Serve customers on time and prevent long queues to keep your supermarket running smoothly.<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850080/extras/388ad2be6a16cadce921863414a15862.poster.avif?t=1751990646\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850080/extras/388ad2be6a16cadce921863414a15862.webm?t=1751990646\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850080/extras/388ad2be6a16cadce921863414a15862.mp4?t=1751990646\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><br><strong><u>KEEP CLEAN</u></strong><br>Keep your store clean by removing empty boxes. You can even use the hand truck to collect and transport them to the trash bin in piles.<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850080/extras/0c7f4489ea4a685ce7f9c101345ba113.poster.avif?t=1751990646\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850080/extras/0c7f4489ea4a685ce7f9c101345ba113.webm?t=1751990646\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850080/extras/0c7f4489ea4a685ce7f9c101345ba113.mp4?t=1751990646\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><br>This demo lets you try out many core features like unloading deliveries, restocking shelves, and handling payments.<br>Vending machines and the storage room will be available in the full version, along with a wider variety of products and shelves to explore.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3850080?t=1751990646","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850080/6bbc6e3cba5b37bba51c83b2dd0c685f90f30b09/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751990646","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850080/8aee68c2506437bfa6c340e33f9c34cc1c832c93/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751990646","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850080/8aee68c25064